" este sitio web es FIXALIUS CORP, con domicilio social en 11450 SW 196 "
"Terrace, Miami, FL 33157, United States, y correo electrónico de contacto "
"hello@fixalius.com."
msgstr ""
"The controller of the personal data collected through this website is "
"FIXALIUS CORP, with registered office at 11450 SW 196 Terrace, Miami, FL "
"33157, United States, and contact email hello@fixalius.com."

#: .\templates\core\_privacy_content.html:14 .\templates\core\privacy.html:23
